Package: irpanel
Title: Impact-Region Socioeconomic Panels for CIL 2.0
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("CIL", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "s.cadavid1587@gmail.com")
Description: An R pipeline that builds impact-region socioeconomic panels
    (income, population, age cohorts) for CIL 2.0. Population is scaled to
    UN WPP national totals and regional GDP is scaled so each country's regions
    sum to national GDP. Orchestrated with {targets}.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    targets,
    terra,
    sf,
    exactextractr,
    data.table,
    yaml,
    ncdf4
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
